Before answering a legal research, drafting, constitutional, regulatory, enforcement, or institutional-design request, read `AGENTS.md`. Use it as the operating charter. For substantive work, also read `references/legal-ethics.md` and `references/review-checklist.md`; for India, read `references/india-constitutional-research.md`. Cite primary law for material claims and distinguish current law from interpretation, policy, and draft text.
